cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Orca AI Incident Archive"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  An open, month-by-month database of real-world AI agent security incidents
  from January 2025 onward. Every record carries a machine-readable YAML
  header, at least one primary source link, and three fields that separate
  demonstrated capability from actual damage: real_harm, ai_involvement and
  kind.
authors:
  - name: "Orca AI Incident Archive contributors"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Continuum-AI-Corp/Orca-AI-Incident-Archive"
url: "https://github.com/Continuum-AI-Corp/Orca-AI-Incident-Archive"
version: "2026.09.16"
date-released: "2026-09-16"
keywords:
  - ai-safety
  - ai-agents
  - security-incidents
  - prompt-injection
  - supply-chain-security
  - incident-database
